@startuml COMP-SEQ09
!include ../_theme.puml
title COMP-SEQ09 UC09 直播预约与用户预约（组件级）
actor "主播" as A
actor "用户" as V
participant "LiveListPage" as P
participant "liveApi" as API
participant "Gin Router / Auth" as R
participant "Schedule Handler" as H
participant "Schedule Worker" as W
database "MySQL" as D

A -> P: 填写并发布计划
P -> API: createSchedule
API -> R: POST /live-schedules
R -> H: CreateScheduleHandler
H -> D: 事务创建计划和关注通知
D --> H: 事务提交
H --> R: pending 计划
R --> API: HTTP 201
API --> P: 展示 pending 计划
V -> P: 点击预约
P -> API: reserveSchedule(id)
API -> R: POST /live-schedules/:id/reserve
R -> H: ReserveScheduleHandler
H -> D: 事务切换预约关系和 reminder_count
D --> H: 事务提交结果
H --> R: reserved + reminderCount
R --> API: HTTP 200
API --> P: 更新预约状态和人数
W -> D: 每 30 秒扫描到期 pending 计划
W -> D: 事务更新 live 并准备直播间/通知
@enduml
